					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: PETALS\nIn the second example we use the Vesica node to create petal-like shapes.\nA Circle Pattern node is used to place the shapes into a circle.\nThe Atan2 and Angle Converter nodes are used to calculate the appropriate angle for each petal.\nWe use an Add and a Sine oscillator to breathe some life into the petals."
					}
				},
